{"id":"n15303-1-9","stage":3,"title":"몸짓 · 身姿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15303-1-9-1","ko":"너는 표정과 몸짓에서 무슨 생각을 하는지가 다 드러나.","zh":"从你的表情和动作就能完全看出来你在想什么。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"표정과","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표정과","audio":"/audio/a32695f2f968f20bdb20.mp3"}},{"text":"몸짓에서","meaning":"身姿，身体动作，体态","explanation":"몸짓：身姿，身体动作，体态；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"몸짓","audio":"/audio/135236429f853bac8098.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15303","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸짓","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸짓에서","audio":"/audio/eb2c905976db4f529344.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"생각을","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각을","audio":"/audio/922a3a2cfe41b93c64d0.mp3"}},{"text":"하는지가","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"en